    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero Slayers</strong> is a <strong>roguelite turn-based strategy RPG</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must shape the fate of <strong>Lucy</strong>, who finds herself trapped in a crisis from which there's no easy escape due to a single misstep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you fail, make different choices next time\u2014so that you may reach a better ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit Allies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by recruiting companions who will assist Lucy on her expedition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609100/extras/ede33fa9f951d7692e175939b8e1bdf0.avif?t=1749578363\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strengthen Heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your allies' <strong>skills and armor</strong> to prepare for the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609100/extras/16a6153717d36861e0c8d4d353803c5d.avif?t=1749578363\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Equip Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip powerful items found during your adventures to become even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609100/extras/740b8c282951d160ca61cdc93ae5b28f.avif?t=1749578363\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t worry if your journey ends in failure.<br>Until your goal is achieved, <strong>time will rewind</strong>\u2014a curse from the gods brings you back to the start.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero Slayers</strong> is a <strong>roguelite turn-based strategy RPG</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must shape the fate of <strong>Lucy</strong>, who finds herself trapped in a crisis from which there's no easy escape due to a single misstep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you fail, make different choices next time\u2014so that you may reach a better ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit Allies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by recruiting companions who will assist Lucy on her expedition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609100/extras/ede33fa9f951d7692e175939b8e1bdf0.avif?t=1749578363\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strengthen Heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your allies' <strong>skills and armor</strong> to prepare for the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609100/extras/16a6153717d36861e0c8d4d353803c5d.avif?t=1749578363\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Equip Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip powerful items found during your adventures to become even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609100/extras/740b8c282951d160ca61cdc93ae5b28f.avif?t=1749578363\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t worry if your journey ends in failure.<br>Until your goal is achieved, <strong>time will rewind</strong>\u2014a curse from the gods brings you back to the start.</p>",
